    rdfs:label "ap1_cal_shoot_reversion_tfl1_steady" ;
    dct:description "RK45 integration of coupled 4-node TFL1-LFY-AP1/CAL-SOC1 Hill ODE system at g_AP1 = 0 (WT TFL1 = 0.017, WT AP1 = 2.313; Lean 4 Law 1). Hill coefficients are hand-tuned to the vendored targets, not the paper's (logical) model" ;
    dct:source "Azpeitia et al. (2021) Science 373:192-197 Figs. 1-2 & Prusinkiewicz et al. (2007) Science 316:1452-1456 (sustained TFL1 shoot identity in ap1 cal / curd meristems vs WT repressed TFL1 = 0.09); target value vendored in Pass 1 reference JSON" ;
    schema:about "Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant)" ;
    schema:error 1.163e-01 ;
    schema:targetValue 1.72e+00 ;
    schema:unitText "normalized_expr" ;
    schema:value 1.718e+00 .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-audit-v3-pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-10> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
        pk:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "pin1_emergent_divergence_angle_deg" ;
    dct:description "Median of 88 successive initiation-azimuth differences pooled over 6 PIN1 mesh runs (2 geometries x 3 radii, after 30-unit burn-in); MAD = 25.6 deg, fraction within +/-15 deg of golden = 0.32" ;
    dct:source "Smyth, Bowman & Meyerowitz (1990) Plant Cell 2:755-767 golden divergence angle 137.5 deg; Jönsson et al. (2006) PNAS 103:1633 & Smith et al. (2006) PNAS 103:1301 (PIN1 transport models reproduce ~137 deg spiral phyllotaxis)" ;
    schema:about "Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant)" ;
    schema:error 2.6237e+00 ;
    schema:targetValue 1.375078e+02 ;
    schema:unitText "deg" ;
    schema:value 1.339e+02 .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-audit-v3-pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-11> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
        pk:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "pin1_initiation_rate_vs_dome_radius_slope_normalised" ;
    dct:description "Linear fit r_p = a + k R of emergent PIN1-mesh initiation rates at R in (0.8, 1.0, 1.2) on the Romanesco cone: k = 0.361, r_p(R0=1) = 0.200, Pearson r = 0.991 (Cauliflower dome: k/r_p = 2.062)" ;
    dct:source "Douady & Couder (1992) Phys. Rev. Lett. 68:2098 Hofmeister inhibitory-field rule: initiation rate proportional to the free perimeter of the initiation ring, i.e. (dr_p/dR)/r_p(R0) = 1/R0 = 1.0" ;
    schema:about "Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant)" ;
    schema:error 8.056e+01 ;
    schema:targetValue 1e+00 ;
    schema:unitText "per_dome_radius" ;
    schema:value 1.8056e+00 .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-audit-v3-pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-12> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
        pk:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "pin1_emergent_plastochron_acceleration_beta" ;
    dct:description "beta_emergent = (k / r_p(R0)) * v_r with vendored radial expansion rate v_r = 0.16: 1.806 * 0.16 = 0.2889; the v_r that would reproduce beta = 0.085 is 0.0471" ;
    dct:source "Azpeitia et al. (2021) Science 373:192-197 Figs. 3-4 Romanesco plastochron acceleration beta = 0.085 (vendored); Lean 4 Law 5 beta = k * v_r" ;
    schema:about "Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant)" ;
    schema:error 2.398824e+02 ;
    schema:targetValue 8.5e-02 ;
    schema:unitText "per_step" ;
    schema:value 2.889e-01 .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-audit-v3-pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-13> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
        pk:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "pin1_ablation_initiation_ratio" ;
    dct:description "Initiations with transport_T = 0 (diffusion only) / initiations with T = 10 on the Romanesco cone at R = 1: 0 / 25; ablation auxin contrast A_max/<A> = 1.000 vs control 3.870" ;
    dct:source "Reinhardt et al. (2003) Nature 426:255-260 (pin1 mutants / NPA-treated apices form no primordia: naked pin inflorescence)" ;
    schema:about "Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant)" ;
    schema:error 0e+00 ;
    schema:targetValue 0e+00 ;
    schema:unitText "ratio" ;
    schema:value 0e+00 .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-audit-v3-pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-14> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
        pk:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "pin1_coupled_tree_parastichy_sum" ;
    dct:description "Curd-scale lattice (T = 80) generated with the EMERGENT PIN1 median divergence angle 133.90 deg instead of the golden angle: measured pair (8, 16) (Fibonacci pair: False)" ;
    dct:source "Azpeitia et al. (2021) Science 373:192-197 Fig. 3 Romanesco (13, 21) contact parastichies" ;
    schema:about "Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant)" ;
    schema:error 2.94118e+01 ;
    schema:targetValue 3.4e+01 ;
