    dct:source "Azpeitia et al. (2021) Science 373:192-197 Fig. 4 & File:Romanesco broccoli (Brassica oleracea).jpg (Wikimedia Commons CC BY-SA 4.0)" ;
    schema:about "Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant)" ;
